OL,3,CBarack Obama set for a Co-Op Live show
OL,4,Cas part of tour
OL,6,FFormer US president Barack Obama is
OL,7,Fset for Manchester this autumn for a
OL,8,Fspecial live interview event, giving
OL,9,Flocal audiences a rare chance to hear
OL,10,Fdirectly from the former US president.
OL,12,FThe 44th president, who made history
OL,13,Fas America's first Black president in
OL,14,F2009, will visit the Co-op Live on 15
OL,15,FOctober as part of his "An Evening
OL,16,FWith President Barack Obama" UK tour.
OL,18,FThe event follows the success of his
OL,19,Fprevious sold-out shows at London's O2
OL,20,Fand Dublin's 3Arena in 2025.
OL,26,@wD@XOUxD@\O]
