OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785161914
OL,3,CBarack Obama set for a Co-Op Live show
OL,4,Cas part of tour
OL,6,FOrganisers promise the one-night-only
OL,7,Fevent will see Obama speak candidly
OL,8,Fabout "what comes next for America,
OL,9,Fand for all of us," in a live
OL,10,Finterview format with a guest
OL,11,Fmoderator - yet to be announced.
OL,13,FRobin Sherry, event organiser at Seat
OL,14,FUnique, said: "Following the
OL,15,Fphenomenal response to last year's
OL,16,Fevents, we are delighted to bring
OL,17,Fthree new opportunities for fans to
OL,18,Fexperience An Evening With President
OL,19,FBarack Obama."
OL,26,@pD@GOUqD@SO]vD@OOU{D@NO]
