OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785161914
OL,3,CBarack Obama set for a Co-Op Live show
OL,4,Cas part of tour
OL,6,FThe Manchester show is part of a short
OL,7,FUK tour, with Obama also appearing at
OL,8,FBelfast's O2 on 13 October and
OL,9,FGlasgow's Ovo Hydro on 14 October.
OL,11,FSince leaving office in 2017, the
OL,12,FHawaii-born former president and his
OL,13,Fwife, Michelle, have launched Higher
OL,14,FGround Productions, producing award-
OL,15,Fwinning films and series for Netflix.
OL,17,FObama's narration of the Netflix
OL,18,Fseries "Our Great National Parks"
OL,19,Fearned him an Emmy, and he has also
OL,20,Fwon Grammy Awards for his audiobook
OL,21,Fmemoirs.
OL,26,@zD@HOUzD@aO]
