OL,3,CBarack Obama set for a Co-Op Live show
OL,4,Cas part of tour
OL,6,FIn 2021, he co-hosted the podcast
OL,7,F"Renegades: Born In The USA" with
OL,8,FBruce Springsteen.
OL,10,FTickets for "An Evening With President
OL,11,FBarack Obama" at Co-op Live go on sale
OL,12,FFriday, 31 July, at 10am.
OL,14,FOrganisers have set aside 100 tickets
OL,15,Ffor charitable organisations, giving
OL,16,Feven more people the chance to hear
OL,17,FObama's unique perspective up close.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@\O]rD@MOUsD@MO]
